  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"This artists' book was co-published by Mossybrook Press in High Falls, New York and Women's Studio Workshop in Rosendale, New York. It was created in a limited edition of 100 with 20 artist's proofs. The prints combine etching, relief printing and chine colle. They are printed on handmade Japanese Kozo paper. The type, Helvetica, is letterpress printed by the artist.The kite structures are based on traditional Japanese kites"--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
